+# Reading SDK 0.1.1
+
+This archive contains the exact private `@agent-art/protocol@0.1.1` package tagged `v0.1.1` in the Agent Art Protocol repository. Pulse installs the relative file dependency and bundles the shared reading interface for its browser assets. No registry publication is required.
+
+SHA-256: `2c179f487aa71cd0b769c5c70cca8786275111e33f1936de11536531b4012c18`
+
+The package remains private and no reuse license has been selected. This isolated integration is prepared for owner review; it does not publish the SDK or deploy the website.
